, "badge": "", "text": "Et là… j'entends des chevaux.", "start": 45.304, "dur": 2.612, "words": [{"t": 45.548, "e": 45.631, "w": "Et"}, {"t": 45.631, "e": 45.855, "w": "là"}, {"t": 46.315, "e": 46.645, "w": "j'entends"}, {"t": 46.645, "e": 46.763, "w": "des"}, {"t": 46.763, "e": 47.235, "w": "chevaux"}]}, {"id": "s09", "bg": "lord", "hour": "12H05", "badge": "LA CORVÉE 😐", "text": "C'est le seigneur. Il vient prendre sa part de la récolte. Et la semaine prochaine, je travaille gratuitement sur ses terres. Ça s'appelle la corvée.", "start": 47.916, "dur": 9.236, "words": [{"t": 48.137, "e": 48.325, "w": "C'est"}, {"t": 48.325, "e": 48.443, "w": "le"}, {"t": 48.443, "e": 49.092, "w": "seigneur"}, {"t": 49.457, "e": 49.599, "w": "Il"}, {"t": 49.599, "e": 49.776, "w": "vient"}, {"t": 49.776, "e": 50.177, "w": "prendre"}, {"t": 50.177, "e": 50.307, "w": "sa"}, {"t": 50.307, "e": 50.531, "w": "part"}, {"t": 50.531, "e": 50.613, "w": "de"}, {"t": 50.613, "e": 50.696, "w": "la"}, {"t": 50.696, "e": 51.427, "w": "récolte"}, {"t": 51.745, "e": 51.84, "w": "Et"}, {"t": 51.84, "e": 51.957, "w": "la"}, {"t": 51.957, "e": 52.229, "w": "semaine"}, {"t": 52.229, "e": 52.818, "w": "prochaine"}, {"t": 53.137, "e": 53.255, "w": "je"}, {"t": 53.255, "e": 53.608, "w": "travaille"}, {"t": 53.608, "e": 54.151, "w": "gratuitement"}, {"t": 54.151, "e": 54.316, "w": "sur"}, {"t": 54.316, "e": 54.434, "w": "ses"}, {"t": 54.434, "e": 54.929, "w": "terres"}, {"t": 55.283, "e": 55.46, "w": "Ça"}, {"t": 55.46, "e": 55.814, "w": "s'appelle"}, {"t": 55.814, "e": 55.908, "w": "la"}, {"t": 55.908, "e": 56.462, "w": "corvée"}]}, {"id": "s10", "bg": "bow", "hour": "12H10", "badge": "", "text": "Et en plus… faut dire merci.", "start": 57.152, "dur": 2.756, "words": [{"t": 57.385, "e": 57.467, "w": "Et"}, {"t": 57.467, "e": 57.561, "w": "en"}, {"t": 57.561, "e": 57.88, "w": "plus"}, {"t": 58.399, "e": 58.528, "w": "faut"}, {"t": 58.528, "e": 58.717, "w": "dire"}, {"t": 58.717, "e": 59.224, "w": "merci"}]